Subject: [PATCH 41/69] docs: add contract upgrade documentation to AGENTS.md

Document the permissionless contract migration mechanism: because all
state is cryptographically self-authorized, ANY node can migrate state
from old contract key to new key. The room owner doesn't need to be
online or take special action.

